              "text_sha256": "35e3b2995685a7dde440b3c9b306ce406f1bba844d2d00fd7e3d8c7497163af9"
            },
            "name": "回末诗",
            "number": 17,
            "text": "**17｜回末诗** **人物无字，作者也无诗偈。**\n\n"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
